Package: com.hass.baidunetdisktools
Name: BaiduNetdiskTools
Version: 2.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
Description: All-in-one Baidu Netdisk iOS 13.35.5 enhancement. Keeps SVIP flag + ad removal, and captures server-signed dlink URLs to /var/mobile/Documents for use with multi-threaded downloaders. Local speed-number hooks were removed because download bandwidth is enforced server-side.
Maintainer: HASS
Author: HASS
Section: Tweaks
Depends: mobilesubstrate
